# HL7 Final Standard PDFs — author-local reference material for the ADR-015
# extraction pipeline. Licensed content: these must never enter this repository
# or any public tree. See NEXT_STEPS.md "Parallel-track / project-owner decisions".
docs/standards/

# HL7 v2.xml schema bundles — author-local reference material for the message-
# structure group names (P8b, G13). Licensed HL7 content: never committed. No
# trailing slash, so a symlink at this path is ignored as well as a directory.
docs/XML-schemas

# No PDF belongs in this repository. The spec PDFs are licensed content and the
# only PDFs we handle; this is a belt-and-braces rule so a copy dropped outside
# docs/standards/ still cannot be committed. No PDF has ever been tracked.
*.pdf
*.PDF

# zvec-grep local semantic index
.zvec-grep/

# SDD plan workspaces (ledger, briefs, review packages) - local scratch
.superpowers/

# Local planning documents (sprint plans, WBS) — not version controlled
planning/
__pycache__/

# Local working notes and assistant settings - not in the repository
the working notes
the editor settings
todoforpublic.md
docs/archive/

# uv-managed virtual environment for the python utilities (just venv)
.venv/
